# OGMP MARS Notification Implementation Plan

## Goal
Implement a simulated "OGMP MARS (Methane Alert and Response System)" notification in the [notification-logic.js](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/h/public/notification-logic.js) file. This will provide users with a rigorous, real-time alert simulation consistent with high-standard methane reporting.

## Proposed Changes

### [public/notification-logic.js](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/h/public/notification-logic.js)

#### [MODIFY]
- Add a simulated check for "Methane Plume Detection".
- **Condition**: Only trigger if `user.orgName` includes "Sonatrach" (case-insensitive).
- **Content**: "OGMP MARS Alert: Methane Plume Detected. Zone: Hassi R'Mel, Area: North Field. Est. Rate: 1,200 kg/hr. Source: UNEP IMEO / Sentinel-5P."
